{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"88dfe968124b22760b2021a1ff05966bca10f085ce6d6eeba0253dacf63dd9ff","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["更美之约的大祭司"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我们所讲的要点是：我们有这样一位大祭司，祂现在已经坐在天上至高上帝的宝座右边，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["并在圣所里供职。这圣所就是真正的圣幕，不是人建立的，而是主亲手建立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["所有的大祭司都是为了向上帝献礼物和祭物而设立的，因此我们这位大祭司也必须有所献上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["祂如果是在地上，根本不会做祭司，因为地上已经有照律法向上帝献礼物的祭司了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["这些祭司的事奉都是仿效和反映天上的事，正如摩西建圣幕的时候，上帝警告他说：",{"text":"“你务要照着在山上指示你的样式造各样器具。”","poem":1},{"noteId":23}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但如今，耶稣得到了一个更超越的职任，正如祂担任了更美之约的中保，这约是根据更美的应许所立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因为如果第一个约没有缺点，就不必另立新约了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["然而，上帝指责祂的子民，说：",{"text":"“主说，看啊，时候将到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要与以色列家和犹大家另立新约，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这约不同于我与他们祖先所立的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是我牵着他们祖先的手领他们离开埃及时所立的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们不持守我的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我不再理会他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主又说，那些日子以后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我将与以色列家立这样的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把我的律法放在他们脑中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"写在他们心上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要做他们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要做我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁都无需再教导自己的邻居和弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说，‘你要认识主。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们无论尊卑都必认识我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要赦免他们的过犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘掉他们的罪恶。”","poem":1},{"noteId":24}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["上帝既然说要立新约，就是把第一个约当作旧的了，那渐渐陈旧过时的很快就会消失。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"出埃及记25:40。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":5}},{"noteId":24,"caller":"+","text":"耶利米书31:31‑34。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HEB/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}